- **Tests**: pytest (config in pyproject.toml)

## Commands

```bash
uv sync                    # Install deps
uv run pytest              # Run tests
uv run ruff check .        # Lint
uv run ruff format .       # Format
uv run mypy src/           # Type check
uv run pre-commit run -a   # Run all pre-commit hooks
```

## Conventions

- Source code lives in `src/{{ python_module_name }}/`
- Tests mirror source structure in `tests/`
- All config (ruff, mypy, pytest) is in `pyproject.toml` — do not create separate config files
- Use `uv run` to execute commands (ensures correct venv)
- Do not commit `.env`, `.databrickscfg`, or any secrets
- CI workflows are defined in `.github/workflows/ci.yml` and call reusable workflows from `{{ github_username }}/platform`
{%- if use_dbt %}
- dbt models follow medallion architecture: bronze (raw) -> silver (cleaned) -> gold (business logic)
{%- endif %}
